{"id":"6a78f267f6eefd08","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-supercompact.md","title":"Supercompact Cardinal","display":"df-supercompact — Supercompact Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-supercompact","aliases":["58-df-supercompact"],"display":"df-supercompact — Supercompact Cardinal","depends_on":["[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-ultrafilter]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-supercompact"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-supercompact</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-supercompact — Supercompact Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"58-df-ultrafilter\">58-df-ultrafilter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FineNormalMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{FineNormalMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LambdaSupercompact}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{LambdaSupercompact}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Supercompact}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\mathrm{Supercompact}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda,U\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda,U\\in V\\)</span> (cardinals and candidate measure)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_\\kappa(\\lambda)=\\{x\\subseteq\\lambda:|x|&lt;\\kappa\\}\">\\(P_\\kappa(\\lambda)=\\{x\\subseteq\\lambda:|x|&lt;\\kappa\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (upstream predicates)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FineNormalMeasure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FineNormalMeasure}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LambdaSupercompact}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LambdaSupercompact}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Supercompact}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Supercompact}_S\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supercompact\\text{-}small\\text{-}subsets}\\vdash\nP_\\kappa(\\lambda)\\coloneqq\\{x\\subseteq\\lambda:|x|&lt;\\kappa\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supercompact\\text{-}small\\text{-}subsets}\\vdash\nP_\\kappa(\\lambda)\\coloneqq\\{x\\subseteq\\lambda:|x|&lt;\\kappa\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supercompact\\text{-}fine\\text{-}normal\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FineNormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,P_\\kappa(\\lambda))\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq U\\;\\bigl(0&lt;|\\mathcal A|&lt;\\kappa\\to\\bigcap\\mathcal A\\in U\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\\{x\\in P_\\kappa(\\lambda):\\alpha\\in x\\}\\in U\\land\n\\forall S\\in U\\;\\forall f\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,S,\\lambda)\\land\\forall x\\in S\\;(f(x)\\in x)\\to\n\\exists\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\\{x\\in S:f(x)=\\alpha\\}\\in U\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supercompact\\text{-}fine\\text{-}normal\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FineNormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,P_\\kappa(\\lambda))\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq U\\;\\bigl(0&lt;|\\mathcal A|&lt;\\kappa\\to\\bigcap\\mathcal A\\in U\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\\{x\\in P_\\kappa(\\lambda):\\alpha\\in x\\}\\in U\\land\n\\forall S\\in U\\;\\forall f\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,S,\\lambda)\\land\\forall x\\in S\\;(f(x)\\in x)\\to\n\\exists\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\\{x\\in S:f(x)=\\alpha\\}\\in U\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lambda\\text{-}supercompact}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LambdaSupercompact}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa\\leq\\lambda\\land\n\\exists U\\in V\\;\\mathrm{FineNormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa,\\lambda)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lambda\\text{-}supercompact}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LambdaSupercompact}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa\\leq\\lambda\\land\n\\exists U\\in V\\;\\mathrm{FineNormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supercompact}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Supercompact}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa\\leq\\lambda\\to\\mathrm{LambdaSupercompact}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}supercompact}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Supercompact}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa\\leq\\lambda\\to\\mathrm{LambdaSupercompact}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_\\kappa(\\lambda)\">\\(P_\\kappa(\\lambda)\\)</span> is defined formally before use.  A fine normal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-complete ultrafilter on it is a first-order ZFC characterization and avoids quantifying over a proper-class map inside the object language.</li>\n<li>The elementary-embedding characterization is equivalent in the metatheory.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false